---

TikFiniTok is a **singleplayer / LAN host** bridge. It does not support dedicated servers.

1. Install **NeoForge** for your Minecraft version.
2. Place the matching TikfiniTok JAR in your `mods` folder. Each release is built for a specific game version.
3. Open a **singleplayer world** with cheats enabled.
4. Leave the world loaded — the local API only runs while the integrated server is up.

Supported versions: Minecraft **1.21.1–1.21.11** (Java 21) and **26.1.2 & 26.2** (Java 25).
